Load up the game per usual with the run botton.

Press on the toggle buttons to toggle on or off different features of the map, including:

- Music
- Display of heat map
- Switching to favorites tab
- Pressing on building to get accurate data

To save a building to your favorites, click on a building, then press the star button in the popup GUI. 

To save the information for future use press the 'save' button. This will automatically save your favorite buildings
across game instances to a JSON file, which will load up upon restarting the game. 

